{"step": "chat: overview", "method": "POST", "path": "/chat/messages", "status": 200, "response": {"reply": "You can spend **฿447.64 per day** for the next 17 days until your next income.\n\n- **Money left:** ฿7,610.00. This is after your reserved bill of ฿1,200.00 (due Oct 25) and ฿5,000.00 of essentials (due Oct 30).\n- **Overspending:** No. No pocket is overspent and there are no pace alerts.\n  - Food: ฿4,016.00 left of ฿4,446.00\n  - Shopping: ฿1,066.00 left of ฿1,666.00\n  - Transport: ฿1,626.00 left of ฿1,666.00\n  - Other: ฿2,222.00 left, with nothing spent\n- **Unassigned:** ฿120.00 of spending has no category. If you assign it, your pocket numbers will be more accurate.\n\nYour history only has a few transactions so far, so these figures rest on limited data.", "cards": [], "tools_used": ["get_overview", "get_insights"], "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5"}}
